## Dagster and software-defined assets

Dagster models pipelines as software-defined assets (the data objects you want to exist) rather than just tasks, making lineage and testing first-class.

## Why it matters
Thinking in assets ('this table should exist and be fresh') maps better to data than thinking in tasks.

## In practice
Declare an asset whose value other assets depend on:

```python
@asset
def stg_orders(): return extract_orders()
@asset
def fct_orders(stg_orders): return transform(stg_orders)
```
